\multicolumn{7}{l}{\textit{Oracle upper bound (gold FOL/DSL + Z3 replaces self-extraction)}} \\
Qwen2.5-14B & FOLIO & 204 & 79.41 & 88.24 & $+$8.82 & $<$0.001 \\
